# ⚡ Model Rules

- 🛡️ Sanitize models exclusively in `ModelManager` / `ModelValidator`.
- 🟢 **Usable menus** = no `paymentRequired` + `available` (live probed) + not failed.
- 💰 **Paid catalog** = `paymentRequired` only. Note: Google AI Studio free-API models are treated as usable, not paid.
- ⛔ Never allow selection of inaccessible models via CLI or REST API.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Post-Prompt Trigger**: After your prompt response is complete, ALWAYS review and update corresponding architecture documentation and tests.
